# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** CPU time is the post-processing time. The three mirror circuits were submitted together in one run, so the recorded QPU and CPU times are for all three circuits together. Each Clifford circuit run contained nine PUBs with different circuit depths, so the recorded times are for all nine PUBs together. Each Ising circuit run contained 10 PUBs with different numbers of Trotter steps, so the recorded times are for all 10 PUBs together.\n"
msgstr "**Catatan:** Waktu CPU adalah waktu post-processing. Ketiga mirror circuit dikirim bersamaan dalam satu run, jadi waktu QPU dan CPU yang tercatat adalah untuk ketiga Circuit sekaligus. Setiap run Clifford circuit berisi sembilan PUB dengan circuit depth berbeda, jadi waktu yang tercatat adalah untuk kesembilan PUB sekaligus. Setiap run Ising circuit berisi 10 PUB dengan jumlah langkah Trotter berbeda, jadi waktu yang tercatat adalah untuk kesepuluh PUB sekaligus.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the mirror circuits, the benchmarks use the RealAmplitudes, TwoLocal, and EfficientSU2 ansätze with 30, 35, and 40 qubits, respectively. The observables consist of a single Pauli-$Z$ operator on a randomly selected qubit, with an ideal expectation value of 1.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mirror circuit, benchmark memakai ansatz RealAmplitudes, TwoLocal, dan EfficientSU2 dengan masing-masing 30, 35, dan 40 Qubit. Observabelnya terdiri dari satu operator Pauli-$Z$ pada Qubit yang dipilih secara acak, dengan nilai ekspektasi ideal 1.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the Clifford circuits, the benchmarks use 50- and 100-qubit circuits with observables initialized as one or more randomly positioned Pauli-$Z$ operators. Operator evolution increases the Pauli weight of these observables, which provides more complex observables for benchmarking. The observables are constructed to have an ideal expectation value of 1, which is independently verified with stabilizer simulation.\n"
msgstr "Untuk Clifford circuit, benchmark memakai Circuit 50 dan 100 Qubit dengan observabel yang diinisialisasi sebagai satu atau lebih operator Pauli-$Z$ pada posisi acak. Evolusi operator meningkatkan Pauli weight observabel ini, yang menyediakan observabel yang lebih kompleks untuk benchmarking. Observabel dibangun agar memiliki nilai ekspektasi ideal 1, yang diverifikasi secara independen dengan simulasi stabilizer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the Trotterized 2D tilted-field Ising (TFI) Hamiltonian simulations, the benchmarks use three parameter regimes: small angle $(\\theta_X,\\theta_Z,\\theta_{ZZ})=(0.1,0.1,0.1)$, near-Clifford $(0.1,0.05,1.5708)$, and chaotic $(0.53,0.1,1.0)$. The observable is the average magnetization,\n"
msgstr "Untuk simulasi Hamiltonian 2D tilted-field Ising (TFI) yang di-Trotterisasi, benchmark memakai tiga rezim parameter: sudut kecil $(\\theta_X,\\theta_Z,\\theta_{ZZ})=(0.1,0.1,0.1)$, near-Clifford $(0.1,0.05,1.5708)$, dan chaotic $(0.53,0.1,1.0)$. Observabelnya adalah magnetisasi rata-rata,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"O_M = \\frac{1}{M}\\sum_i Z_i,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"O_M = \\frac{1}{M}\\sum_i Z_i,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $M$ is the number of qubits in the simulation. Ideal expectation values are computed with sparse Pauli dynamics (SPD), a Pauli propagation method, and are validated against Qiskit statevector simulations for circuits with fewer than 29 qubits.\n"
msgstr "di mana $M$ adalah jumlah Qubit dalam simulasi. Nilai ekspektasi ideal dihitung dengan sparse Pauli dynamics (SPD), sebuah metode propagasi Pauli, dan divalidasi terhadap simulasi statevector Qiskit untuk Circuit dengan kurang dari 29 Qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For all benchmarks, mitigation accuracy is calculated as\n"
msgstr "Untuk semua benchmark, akurasi mitigasi dihitung sebagai\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{Accuracy}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathrm{Accuracy}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\left(\n"
"1-\n"
"\\frac{\n"
"\\left|\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}-\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{mitigated}}\\right|\n"
"}{\n"
"\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}\n"
"}\n"
"\\right)\\times100\\%,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\left(\n"
"1-\n"
"\\frac{\n"
"\\left|\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}-\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{mitigated}}\\right|\n"
"}{\n"
"\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}\n"
"}\n"
"\\right)\\times100\\%,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}$ and $\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{mitigated}}$ are the ideal and mitigated expectation values, respectively.\n"
msgstr "di mana $\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{ideal}}$ dan $\\langle O\\rangle_{\\mathrm{mitigated}}$ masing-masing adalah nilai ekspektasi ideal dan yang dimitigasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get support {#get-support}"
msgstr "Dapatkan dukungan {#get-support}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AI-QEM support team is here to help. If you encounter any issues, have questions about using the AI-QEM Function, or need help troubleshooting a job, contact the support team.\n"
msgstr "Tim dukungan AI-QEM siap membantu. Jika kamu menemui masalah, punya pertanyaan tentang cara memakai Fungsi AI-QEM, atau butuh bantuan memecahkan masalah sebuah job, hubungi tim dukungan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support: quantumfunction.support@ltm.com\n"
msgstr "Dukungan: quantumfunction.support@ltm.com\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To help the support team investigate and resolve your issue as quickly as possible, include the following information in your support request:\n"
msgstr "Agar tim dukungan bisa menyelidiki dan menyelesaikan masalahmu secepat mungkin, sertakan informasi berikut dalam permintaan dukunganmu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function job ID (for example, `job.job_id`)\n"
msgstr "ID job fungsi (misalnya, `job.job_id`)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A detailed description of the issue\n"
msgstr "Deskripsi detail tentang masalahnya\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Any relevant error messages, stack traces, or error codes\n"
msgstr "Pesan error, stack trace, atau kode error yang relevan\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expected behavior and actual behavior (if applicable)\n"
msgstr "Perilaku yang diharapkan dan perilaku sebenarnya (jika ada)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete information helps the support team diagnose issues more efficiently and resolve them faster.\n"
msgstr "Informasi yang lengkap membantu tim dukungan mendiagnosis masalah dengan lebih efisien dan menyelesaikannya lebih cepat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AI-QEM support team also welcomes feedback and feature requests. If you have suggestions for improvements or capabilities that you want to see in future releases, send them to quantumfunction.support@ltm.com.\n"
msgstr "Tim dukungan AI-QEM juga menyambut masukan dan permintaan fitur. Jika kamu punya saran perbaikan atau kemampuan yang ingin kamu lihat di rilis mendatang, kirimkan ke quantumfunction.support@ltm.com.\n"

